    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0428" n="314" xml:id="pg314"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">462.00R296/4701: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chargé in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Atherton</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-23T13:00:00-04:00">July 23, 1931—1
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>234. For Secretary Stimson.</p>
                <p>“I wish to convey to you my sincere congratulations. My appreciation is the
                    deeper from knowing the complexity of the difficulties which confronted you over
                    the past 10 days and the able manner they have been surmounted. I hope you may
                    now secure a real rest. Herbert Hoover”.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castile</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
